":"探索性终点的统计分析方法"}],"heading":"探索性目的和探索性终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的探索性目的为初步观察维持性血液透析患者中透析日与非透析日之间瘙痒症状的差异，以期为后续研究设计提供方向性参考。对应的探索性终点为透析日与非透析日瘙痒差异。该终点旨在描述同一受试者在透析日与非透析日之间瘙痒严重程度的变化模式，不作为确证性疗效判断依据，不纳入主要或关键次要假设检验。探索性分析结果仅用于描述性呈现和假设生成，不用于支持注册性结论。","rationale":"探索性终点'透析日与非透析日瘙痒差异'已在项目研究定义中确认。该章节正文依据此确认事实撰写。需医学经理确认：该探索性终点的具体测量工具（是否沿用WI-NRS或其他量表）、采集频率（每日记录还是特定访视回顾）、分析策略（配对比较还是混合模型）以及是否设置多重性校正。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ee74b6fda2c2_78b081c324cd1946","section_number":"3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:0be1ca5d5330d7c41231946f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006130311_c7ef41d6","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照 II 期试验。两臂 1:1（KRX-451 2mg bid / 匹配安慰剂），12 周双盲治疗 + 4 周安全随访。","quote_sha256":"cceaa0b3181433bed5b07e3758770a9df017d9740be3402fd284910e540dd47d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"研究时期：双盲治疗期 12 周；安全随访期 4 周","quote_sha256":"dfa0e99a146665ad140a86b132ab0391c121403a3bea8a664b1a6de258b03035","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"KRX-451 2 mg bid 口服，透析日于透析开始前给药，双盲治疗 12 周","quote_sha256":"75102cc2692ea07e8645365bdbebf5aa955de46456b084c9622f59c02d45d0a9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"主要终点：第 12 周周平均最重瘙痒 WI-NRS 较基线的变化。基线为随机前 7 天每日最重瘙痒均值；第 12 周周平均为第 12 周对应 7 天评分均值。","quote_sha256":"1d85c5edfa83068aa5705940cbd8bb9b856bd65ba60201342ca748c581a0b534","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es5"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"按组间差 1.5 分、标准差 3.0、把握度 80%、双侧 α=0.05 估算，计入15%脱落，拟随机120例。","quote_sha256":"c752e49137b104409e012cfa68af7b60f4b136d17c7eed05b491926d3ebb76f5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es6"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"18–80 岁、维持性血液透析≥3 个月且每周透析 3 次的患者。入组前 4 周周平均最重瘙痒 WI-NRS ≥5 分，且常规抗组胺药和/或润肤剂无效。","quote_sha256":"010eadbccff7fbefd5b1bdde5cf0c86e8371fc927e3f1dfd5b1a9adeb960e41f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es9"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es2","es3","es4","es5","es6","es9"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认随机化方法（如区组随机、分层随机）、区组大小、分层因素（如透析中心、基线WI-NRS水平等）","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_4_1","missing_source_classes":["项目研究定义未指定随机化具体方法与分层因素"],"target":"随机化方法与分层因素"},{"action":"确认各访视时间点、每次访视的评估项目（生命体征、实验室检查、心电图、瘙痒评分等）及窗口期","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_4_2","missing_source_classes":["项目研究定义注明'原文未提供完整访视计划'"],"target":"完整访视计划"},{"action":"确认双盲维护措施（药物外观匹配、标签编码）、紧急揭盲条件与流程、统一揭盲时点","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_4_3","missing_source_classes":["项目研究定义未指定盲态维护与揭盲具体流程"],"target":"盲态维护与揭盲流程"}],"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照的II期临床试验，采用平行组设计，试验组与对照组按1:1比例随机分配。试验组接受KRX-451 2 mg每日两次口服给药，对照组接受匹配安慰剂。研究分为双盲治疗期和安全随访期两个阶段：双盲治疗期持续12周，安全随访期持续4周。研究人群为18至80岁、维持性血液透析至少3个月且每周透析3次的慢性肾病相关瘙痒患者，入组前4周周平均最重瘙痒WI-NRS评分不低于5分，且常规抗组胺药和/或润肤剂治疗无效。主要疗效终点为第12周周平均最重瘙痒WI-NRS较基线的变化，基线定义为随机前7天每日最重瘙痒评分的均值，第12周周平均定义为第12周对应7天评分的均值。样本量按组间差1.5分、标准差3.0、把握度80%、双侧显著性水平0.05估算，计入15%脱落率后拟随机入组120例。","rationale":"研究设计各要素（多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、1:1、12周治疗加4周随访、人群定义、主要终点定义、样本量参数）均来源于项目研究定义R6D-W6-CKDaP-KRX451修订版6。需医学经理确认：随机化具体方法（区组大小、分层因素及分层水平）、各访视时间点与评估项目、盲态维护与紧急揭盲流程、安全性评估的具体时点与项目。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ee74b6fda2c2_7ea4132626b6d57b","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:0be1ca5d5330d7c41231946f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006130311_c7ef41d6","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照 II 期试验。两臂 1:1（KRX-451 2mg bid / 匹配安慰剂），12 周双盲治疗 + 4 周安全随访。","quote_sha256":"cceaa0b3181433bed5b07e3758770a9df017d9740be3402fd284910e540dd47d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"研究时期：双盲治疗期 12 周；安全随访期 4 周","quote_sha256":"dfa0e99a146665ad140a86b132ab0391c121403a3bea8a664b1a6de258b03035","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"KRX-451 2 mg bid 口服，透析日于透析开始前给药，双盲治疗 12 周","quote_sha256":"75102cc2692ea07e8645365bdbebf5aa955de46456b084c9622f59c02d45d0a9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"主要终点：第 12 周周平均最重瘙痒 WI-NRS 较基线的变化。基线为随机前 7 天每日最重瘙痒均值；第 12 周周平均为第 12 周对应 7 天评分均值。","quote_sha256":"1d85c5edfa83068aa5705940cbd8bb9b856bd65ba60201342ca748c581a0b534","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es5"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:revision:6","quote":"主要终点用协方差分析，协变量含基线 WI-NRS 及分层因素。应答率用分层 CMH 检验。","quote_sha256":"51e88fbd879d6f3371e0971a3fe5a05a206940e91a80c084f7e6e87a61834c6d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","span_id":"es10"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es2","es3","es4","es5","es10"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[],"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组设计。受试者按1:1比例随机分配至KRX-451 2 mg每日两次口服组或匹配安慰剂组。双盲治疗期持续12周，其后进入4周安全随访期。试验组给药方案为KRX-451 2 mg每日两次口服，透析日于透析开始前给药。研究在多个血液透析中心开展，不设自适应设计、样本量再估计、期中分析、安全审查委员会或独立数据监查委员会。主要疗效分析采用协方差分析，协变量包括基线WI-NRS评分及分层因素；关键次要终点应答率采用分层Cochran-Mantel-Haenszel检验。全分析集为主要分析集，分析人群为按随机分配的治疗策略。","rationale":"总体设计要素（多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、1:1、12周加4周、透析前给药、无自适应/无期中/无SRC/无DMC、ANCOVA与CMH分析方法、FAS与治疗策略估计目标）均来源于项目研究定义修订版6。需医学经理确认：分层因素的具体内容与水平、各中心透析排班对给药时间窗的影响、安全随访期的具体评估项目。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（总体设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ee74b6fda2c2_111b14fe86421ce6","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:0be1ca5d5330d7c41231946f","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_466a0de7c48143873a5a:r6:fba9cc6529136766","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006130311_c7ef41d6","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取KRX-451非临床药效学（动物瘙痒模型）和毒理学（重复给药毒性、安全药理学）研究报告","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_4_2_1_1","missing_source_classes":["非临床药效学研究数据","非临床毒理学数据"],"target":"非临床药效学与毒理学数据"},{"action":"获取KRX-451 I期或早期临床的PK/PD数据及既往同类κ阿片受体激动剂的临床剂量-反应信息","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_4_2_1_2","missing_source_classes":["人体药代动力学与药效学数据","既往同类κ阿片受体激动剂临床剂量-反应数据"],"target":"人体PK/PD及既往临床剂量数据"},{"action":"获取KRX-451研究者手册中关于临床剂量选择的依据描述","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_4_2_1_3","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册"],"target":"研究者手册剂量选择章节"}],"heading":"剂量选择依据","missing_source_classes":["非临床药效学研究数据（动物瘙痒模型中κ受体激动剂的抗瘙痒效应及剂量-反应关系）","非临床毒理学数据（重复给药毒性、安全药理学、安全窗）","人体药代动力学与药效学数据（I期或早期临床中KRX-451的PK参数、暴露量-效应关系）","既往同类κ阿片受体激动剂临床剂量-反应数据"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"剂量选择依据章节需要非临床研究数据（动物模型中的抗瘙痒药效学、受体选择性验证、毒理学安全窗）、人体药代动力学与药效学数据（I期或早期临床中2 mg bid的暴露量-效应关系）、以及既往同类κ阿片受体激动剂的临床剂量-反应数据作为支撑。当前项目研究定义仅确认了靶点机制（外周选择性κ阿片受体激动剂，不激动μ受体）和研究目的（概念验证与剂量探索），但未提供非临床药效学数据、动物毒理学数据、人体PK/PD数据或既往临床剂量信息，无法形成有实质证据支持的剂量选择依据正文。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（剂量选择依据）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ee74b6fda2c2_3f2e2937fe4b5e0c","section_number":"4.2.1","source_ids":["pro